{"id":"control","lemma":"control","pos":"noun","rank":465,"glosses":["control, or running of a business","control of a machine","control or emotional restraint, self-control"],"ipa":"/konˈtɾol/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"controles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-control.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hazte con el control.","en":"Take command.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438971"},{"text":"Usa el control manual.","en":"Use the manual override.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599207"},{"text":"Todo está bajo control.","en":"Everything's under control.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524499"},{"text":"Lo tenemos bajo control.","en":"We've got it under control.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581977"},{"text":"¿Dónde está el control remoto?","en":"Where's the remote?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798372"}]}